-- The agreements' root (MMS-521): every collective agreement that speaks to
-- an item of the shared vocabulary (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), gathered from
-- one root per family of agreements, as the corpus groups them (MMS-548):
-- l4/lib/ofek-hadash-root.l4, l4/lib/oz-latmura-root.l4 and
-- l4/lib/teachers-general-root.l4 (MMS-518).
--
-- It is a `collection root` (l4/lib/precedence.l4), and so is each family:
-- the agreements' own precedence is this root's to apply (the client,
-- 2026-10-22: "agreement precedence is the agreement root's
-- responsibility"). One rule, two halves (the client, 2026-11-13, MMS-686;
-- conventions instruments.amendment-chain and instruments.side-by-side,
-- picks for the lawyer):
--   - between agreements of the SAME parties on the same matter, the later
--     replaces the earlier, even where it gives less: the earlier provision
--     was changed lawfully, and §19 of the Collective Agreements Law keeps a
--     personal provision in the contract only while it is not. The parties
--     are each agreement's own (`signed by`, read from its preamble); the
--     matter is the pay item; the later is the later signed of those that
--     speak in the salary month;
--   - between agreements that apply SIDE BY SIDE (different parties), the
--     provision in the employee's favour governs (§23).
-- The rule is applied once, over every family's claims together, so that a
-- later agreement replaces an earlier one of the same parties in another
-- family too; each family's own page rules among its agreements the same
-- way. The root (l4/lib/root.l4) sets this collection's ruling against the
-- takanon's and the circulars'.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT precedence
IMPORT collective_agreements_law
IMPORT `ofek-hadash-root`
IMPORT `oz-latmura-root`
IMPORT `teachers-general-root`

§ `שורש ההסכמים — מה ההסכמים אומרים על כל פריט`

§§ `סעיף 19 — ההסכם המאוחר בין אותם צדדים מחליף את המוקדם`

GIVEN a IS A LIST OF `signatory`
      b IS A LIST OF `signatory`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `every party of the one signed the other` a b IF
    all (GIVEN p YIELD any (GIVEN q YIELD p EQUALS q) b) a

-- Two agreements are of the same parties when each was signed by every
-- party that signed the other.
GIVEN a IS A `claim`, b IS A `claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `made between the same parties` a b IF
        `every party of the one signed the other` (a's `by`'s `signed by`) (b's `by`'s `signed by`)
    AND `every party of the one signed the other` (b's `by`'s `signed by`) (a's `by`'s `signed by`)

-- A later agreement of the same parties speaks to the item in the salary
-- month: its claim is among the claims. Two signed on one day do not
-- replace each other.
GIVEN x IS A `claim`, claims IS A LIST OF `claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a later agreement of the same parties speaks` x claims IF
    any (GIVEN y YIELD `made between the same parties` x y
                       AND DATE_SERIAL (y's `by`'s `issued`) GREATER THAN DATE_SERIAL (x's `by`'s `issued`))
        claims

-- The provision a claim rests on, as §19 asks of it: a pay term of an
-- agreement that applies to the teacher and his employer (the claim's own
-- file decides that), changed lawfully where a later agreement of the same
-- parties speaks to the same item in the month.
GIVEN x IS A `claim`, claims IS A LIST OF `claim`
GIVETH AN `agreement provision`
DECIDE `the provision the claim rests on` x claims IS
    `agreement provision` WITH
        `is about terms of work, the end of work, or a duty or right of the employee and employer` IS TRUE
        `the agreement applies to the employer and the employee` IS TRUE
        `changed or cancelled lawfully` IS `a later agreement of the same parties speaks` x claims

-- §19: the claims whose provision is still part of the teacher's contract
-- of employment. These, and no others, are what §23 weighs.
GIVEN claims IS A LIST OF `claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the claims §19 leaves in force` claims IS
    filter (GIVEN x YIELD `is part of the employee's contract of employment` (`the provision the claim rests on` x claims)) claims

§§ `סעיף 23 — ההוראה שלטובת העובד`

GIVEN a IS A `claim`, b IS A `claim`
GIVETH A `claim`
DECIDE `the agreement more favourable to the employee` a b IS
    IF `the amount that governs between agreements` (a's `answer`) (b's `answer`) EQUALS a's `answer` THEN a ELSE b

-- Among the agreements §19 leaves, the one whose provision is in the
-- employee's favour (§23). The ruling names the rule that decided it: §23
-- where two or more were left, §19 where one was left of several, and the
-- only instrument that speaks where one spoke.
GIVEN claims IS A LIST OF `claim`
GIVETH A MAYBE `ruling`
DECIDE `the ruling among agreements` claims IS
    CONSIDER `the claims §19 leaves in force` claims
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN a FOLLOWED BY more THEN
        JUST (`the ruling for`
                  (foldr (GIVEN c, acc YIELD `the agreement more favourable to the employee` acc c) a more)
                  (BRANCH IF NOT null more THEN `§23: the provision in the employee's favour`
                          IF null (drop 1 claims) THEN `the only instrument that speaks`
                          OTHERWISE `§19: the later agreement of the same parties replaces the earlier`))

§§ `המשפחות`

-- Each family of agreements is a collection root of its own, ruling among
-- its agreements by the same rule: §19 between agreements of the same
-- parties, §23 between those left.
`the Ofek Hadash agreements' root` MEANS
    `collection root` WITH
        `the collection`  IS "הסכמי אופק חדש"
        `its instruments` IS `the Ofek Hadash agreements' instruments`
        `what each says`  IS `the Ofek Hadash agreements' claims on`
        `its ruling`      IS (GIVEN i, c YIELD `the ruling among agreements` (`the Ofek Hadash agreements' claims on` i c))

`the Oz LaTmura agreements' root` MEANS
    `collection root` WITH
        `the collection`  IS "הסכמי עוז לתמורה"
        `its instruments` IS `the Oz LaTmura agreements' instruments`
        `what each says`  IS `the Oz LaTmura agreements' claims on`
        `its ruling`      IS (GIVEN i, c YIELD `the ruling among agreements` (`the Oz LaTmura agreements' claims on` i c))

`the teachers' general agreements' root` MEANS
    `collection root` WITH
        `the collection`  IS "הסכמים כלליים לעובדי הוראה"
        `its instruments` IS `the teachers' general agreements' instruments`
        `what each says`  IS `the teachers' general agreements' claims on`
        `its ruling`      IS (GIVEN i, c YIELD `the ruling among agreements` (`the teachers' general agreements' claims on` i c))

`the families of agreements` MEANS
    LIST `the Ofek Hadash agreements' root`, `the Oz LaTmura agreements' root`, `the teachers' general agreements' root`

§§ `המסמכים`

-- The families' roots register their own agreements; this root includes
-- them all, family by family.
`the agreements' instruments` MEANS
    concat (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `its instruments`) `the families of agreements`)

§§ `מה ההסכמים אומרים, לפי פריט`

GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the agreements' claims on` i c IS
    concat (map (GIVEN r YIELD `what the collection's instruments say` r i c) `the families of agreements`)

-- The rule once, over every family's claims together.
GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A MAYBE `ruling`
DECIDE `the agreements' ruling on` i c IS
    `the ruling among agreements` (`the agreements' claims on` i c)

`the agreements' root` MEANS
    `collection root` WITH
        `the collection`  IS "ההסכמים הקיבוציים"
        `its instruments` IS `the agreements' instruments`
        `what each says`  IS `the agreements' claims on`
        `its ruling`      IS `the agreements' ruling on`
